  Tested      NexClash differential verification against two whole recordings,
              both builds; simulated boot; run in OverSpec from its menu,
              default and Enhanced. Not on real hardware.

  Replay      IDENTICAL on two whole recordings, both builds: 147,152 frames,
              154,081 figures, 180 wipes; 9 of 9 broken builds detected

  Emulator    OverSpec: from the patch menu, default and Enhanced, through
              lost lives to game over and the title, scripted keys

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
